  "body": "Add Logger Class to the OptimizeVQA. \r\nThe Logger Class takes care of the logic required to record attributes of the optimization like best cost, best parameters and the output distribution.\r\n\r\nMinor changes to error prints related to connecting to the IBMQPUs.\r\n\r\nChange to the dictionary output from `results_information` of the OptimizeVQA Class. Removed the results obtained from `scipy.minimize` function.\r\n\r\nAdded partial results return feature. If a connection error is observed for the IBMQPUs, after some number of retries is performed, if the error persists, the optimization loop is terminated. The user is able to retrieve the results obtained so far through the `results_information` method of the OptimizeVQA Class. ",
  "created_at": "2022-05-12T10:17:11Z",
